    <item>
      <title>Corrected: PHP2Shell: AI-assisted discovery of PHP flaws, followed by real attacks up to a wiper (EV-0087)</title>
      <link>https://xindaan.github.io/risk-observatory/en/events/EV-0087/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">2026-11-22/EV-0087/CORRECTED/2</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <category>Corrected</category>
      <description>Supplemented with reports by CBS News and Fox Business (17/18 November 2026): the NSA network outage is linked to patching the PHP2Shell flaws. On reassessment the core is now considered independently confirmed because several independent sources support it; attribution drops to medium and origin to unclear, because AI involvement is documented only for discovering the flaws, not for the attacks.</description>
